error[E0277]: `Vec<String>` cannot be a field of search parameters
 --> tests/ui/fail/search_field_list.rs:9:11
  |
9 |     tags: Vec<String>,
  |           ^^^ the trait `Segment` is not implemented for `Vec<String>`
  |
  = note: a search field is a string, a number, a `bool`, an enum with `#[derive(Segment)]`, or an `Option` of one, because the query string holds one text value per field
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Segment`:
            Rest
            String
            i32
            i64
            u32
            u64
  = note: required for `Vec<String>` to implement `SearchValue`
